                <pb facs="0362" n="356" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg356"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-11-27"><hi rendition="#italic">November 27,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs states war vessel not ordered Bluefields, and
                    British notification to Nicaraguan commissioner merely caveat pending
                    discussion, and not intended as conclusive. Dispatches now on way explain
                    situation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bayard.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
